{"ID":"20240513083016-ub9ekc9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083016-ub9ekc9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083016-ub9ekc9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172600-ntgbeqi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172600-ntgbeqi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172600-ntgbeqi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:325\u0026#125;","title":"298","type":"doc","updated":"20240514175152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513172600-ntgbeqi","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 861px;","id":"20240513172600-ntgbeqi","updated":"20240514175152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"       初診日期：2008/3/24"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"221-1 L, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46 y/o，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/3/24"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去年十月被告知ALS，去年五月左腿肌肉萎縮(因為火不生土了)且時肌肉跳痛如電擊般，會突然肌肉無力。此人母親43歲亦發此病，並於發病後三年歿。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尚好，睡時左足冷右足熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。易脹氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三~四次/天，此情形已兩年。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有，喜溫飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、問汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"易出汗，一動則易出大汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體力差，陽反應少。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以前怕熱，現在怕冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右肝區下方損傷，肝紋過於平整有脂肪肝。心臟色淡。右腎陽不足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、身體："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第五椎與第六椎之間壓痛，耳心區壓痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心陽不足，表虛，裡腎陽亦不足。ALS是裡寒。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"公孫 內關 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巨闕 關元 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陰陵泉 足三里 三陰交 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心俞 脾俞 肺俞 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左足陽陵泉透陰陵泉"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃耆八錢 麥冬五錢 桂枝四錢 白芍四錢 生薑兩片"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附五錢 白朮四錢 茯苓五錢 炙甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枳實三錢 澤瀉六錢 豬苓三錢兩付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 此病介於白血病與紅斑性狼瘡之間。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 此人當初發病時自覺第五椎會痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 心火要下達必須靠肺水之助，若肺功能不佳且心火不足則熱會反逆，肺水會無法下降而從汗出，故此人多汗，用黃耆固表炮附歛汗，麥冬潤肺。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 此方為黃耆建中湯、苓桂朮甘湯、五苓散與真武湯的加減。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 很多ALS都從左側開始發病，因左主陰，右主陽"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}